We are pleased to confirm you as an authorized user of the ACM Sanctions Database. Your authorization is valid through 11-JUN-2027. Before making volunteer appointments, candidate nominations, or conferring awards, it is important to check the database to determine eligibility of each appointee or nominee.

To access the database and get instructions for its use, go to https://policies.acm.org/potentialViolations.cfm. Log in using your ACM Account username and password (this is what you use across ACM systems such as myACM and the ACM DL).